Package: skeletograph
Title: Anatomically-Located Skeletal Observation Plots
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Alexandra"", "Doubleday", email = "a.doubleday1312@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Plots individual palaeopathology, trauma, entheseal change, and
    taphonomic observations onto a standard anterior-view human skeleton
    diagram at anatomically-specified locations (e.g. "midshaft, lateral
    femur"), and separately aggregates observations across a skeletal
    population into per-element heatmaps. Built on ggplot2, in the spirit
    of gganatogram but for the skeleton and for bioarchaeological recording
    categories.
